# Monitoring & Alerting

## Tenderly (Smart Contract Monitoring)
TENDERLY_PROJECT=your-project-slug
TENDERLY_ACCOUNT=your-account-name
TENDERLY_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key
TENDERLY_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL=https://api.tenderly.co/webhook/...

## Sentry (Frontend Error Tracking)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=https://your-dsn.ingest.sentry.io/...
SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=your-auth-token
SENTRY_ORG=your-org
SENTRY_PROJECT=your-project

## Datadog (Infrastructure Monitoring)
DATADOG_API_KEY=your-api-key
DATADOG_APP_KEY=your-app-key
DATADOG_SITE=datadoghq.com

## UptimeRobot (Availability Monitoring)
UPTIMEROBOT_API_KEY=your-api-key
UPTIMEROBOT_MONITOR_IDS=12345678,87654321

## Alerting
ALERT_EMAILS=team@example.com,security@example.com
ALERT_SLACK_WEBHOOK=https://hooks.slack.com/services/...
ALERT_PAGERDUTY_SERVICE_KEY=your-service-key

# Existing environment variables
PRIVATE_KEY=your-private-key
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAIN_ID=8453
NEXT_PUBLIC_ONCHAINKIT_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
NEXT_PUBLIC_ONCHAINKIT_API_KEY=your-api-key
STORY_TEMPLATE_SIGNER_PRIVATE_KEY=your-signer-private-key
BASESCAN_API_KEY=your-basescan-api-key